The test is timing out on Raspberry Pi devices in CI. I suspect it is due to the known issue that (probably because they are operating on NFS mounts) opening a file on those devices can keep the event loop open if there is not an explicit close. I suspect this change or something similar will resolve that issue.

```suggestion
      'x'.repeat(writes * size));
    fs.closeSync(fd);
```

Yeah, let’s just try that :)
